m&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfvWKZZrEJBv00syOg-oT88PxAkYv9Urlgt2QwkaA17X9Q&oe=69A997F3"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-04.png", "id": "1830449300822153", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982610_1830449304155486_9105627070072408848_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dOVOrwvQy28Q7kNvwGemdFa&_nc_oc=AdmogBDLM55IAS689Oui2ZeKVnpJtM7NTqGNJbByN0IkSkX0Tfpj3VAc8ttg6KZVJns&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afs1ABBzRWYmG7MiHW7k9X-VivLDPkqBz26cuLST9u4hIQ&oe=69A9674A"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-13.png", "id": "9449026898446045", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974691_9449026905112711_4579666727095828995_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-8l5_sl2sMYQ7kNvwHoVw8A&_nc_oc=AdmktJBA52cX03wl-cydyHtazWTtonhNNgDirjN_xzUjTRdUBu6V8YJJxtJ-HAg5tbo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Aftgrj6GL-1dD8Uij_2FdNQzCPLZCnHGW6SOlGsrt__35w&oe=69A97784"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-11.png", "id": "1969264830167481", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974803_1969264833500814_717700601129842921_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bEbWdbkhx3IQ7kNvwFLeWKa&_nc_oc=Adnbb_i8cP2m71pug54DldOPPBZtw-72QCBJfm1SgCC-u1TLC-tIJW_X91NU5PhRalg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfuBzStwlqzzfNj6CTtB-3kwiqKsY2RNjiR49LuUr5w_4Q&oe=69A97D5E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer-Cover-Image-MINI.png", "id": "1128857345307826", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/43997708_1128857348641159_7151441411599407678_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FSu9YJVG1qUQ7kNvwEnZsft&_nc_oc=AdlhAXn1l5zprb4vFGsRfbDWpCca3Yi6fA9oop1LtXBNYyNbIAqZ7ihoyvLM9WRYRh0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfuQSte8JbGb6eSyH9lAdublo7bJtyj1xxcnBJ5obkYEhQ&oe=69A9680C"}, "display_name": "Squingle Mini", "keywords": ["puzzle", "MR", "puzzling", "demo", "squingle"], "long_description": "# \ud83c\udf00 Buy Squingle Mini for only $0.99 and save $2 on the full game when you upgrade!\n\nSquingle Mini, offers an incredible bite-sized experience of the unique Mixed Reality 3D puzzle game, Squingle. \n\nEmbark on a journey where the lines between the virtual and real worlds blur, offering endless fun and mind-bending challenges.\n\nGuide the orbs from start to finish, avoid the edges, and collect points as you navigate through glass-like mazes called \u2018Squingles.\u2019\ud83c\udf20\n\n\n# \ud83c\udf08 A VISUAL MASTERPIECE\nEach maze is a stunning, morphing, glass-like sculpture that comes to life in either Mixed Reality or a fully immersive environment, offering an unmatched visual experience in the puzzle genre.\n\n\n# \ud83e\udde9 ACCESSIBILITY\nDesigned to be accessible for a wide range of players and skill levels, with intuitive controls and hand-tracking support for seamless play, whether standing or seated.\n\n\n# \ud83d\ude0c GLOBAL LEADERBOARD\nCompete on the Squingle Mini Leaderboard! See the sum of your best times across all levels and compare them with others around the globe.\n\n \n# \ud83d\udc7b RACE YOUR GHOST\nChallenge your best times on each level to improve your leaderboard rank for endless fun!\n\n\n# \ud83c\udf00 Immerse yourself in the world of Squingle, where every twist presents a new challenge! \ud83c\udf20", "short_description": "\ud83c\udf00 Buy Squingle Mini for only $0.99 and save $2 on the full game when you upgrade!\n\nSquingle Mini, offers an incredible bite-sized experience of the unique Mixed Reality 3D puzzle game, Squingle. \n\nEmbark on a journey where the lines between the virtual and real worlds blur, offering endless fun and mind-bending challenges.\n\nGuide the orbs from start to finish, avoid the edges, and collect points as you navigate through glass-like mazes called \u2018Squingles.\u2019\ud83c\udf20"}]}, "developer_name": "Dr. Benjamin Outram ", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://squingle.com/p